e": "Model Specification subheading"}, {"id": 129, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "hedging", "lines": [[133, 133]], "note": "caveat that the logistic model's linearity assumption may not hold for all relationships"}, {"id": 130, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[134, 134]], "assertion": "interaction effects were not tested for whether the skin tone effect varies by league, position, or referee bias", "polarity": "did_not", "targets": ["interaction effects", "skin tone"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 131, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[135, 135]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 132, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[136, 136]], "note": "External Validity subheading"}, {"id": 133, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "hedging", "lines": [[137, 137]], "note": "caveat that generalizability beyond European male pro soccer 2012-2013 is uncertain"}, {"id": 134, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "hedging", "lines": [[138, 138]], "note": "caveat that referee training/bias awareness may have changed since 2012"}, {"id": 135, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[139, 139]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 136, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[140, 140]], "note": "Multiple Comparisons subheading"}, {"id": 137, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "hedging", "lines": [[141, 141]], "note": "caveat about specification searching/publication bias given prior dataset use"}, {"id": 138, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[142, 142]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 139, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[143, 143]], "note": "Implicit Bias Measurement subheading"}, {"id": 140, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "hedging", "lines": [[144, 144]], "note": "caveat that aggregate meanIAT introduces measurement error and ecological fallacy concerns"}, {"id": 141, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[145, 145]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 142, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[146, 147]], "note": "section divider"}, {"id": 143, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[148, 149]], "note": "Assumptions and Their Assessment heading"}, {"id": 144, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[150, 151]], "note": "Key Assumptions for Causal Inference subheading"}, {"id": 145, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[152, 152]], "note": "numbered assumption title: No Unmeasured Confounding"}, {"id": 146, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "framing", "lines": [[153, 153]], "note": "states the conditional-exchangeability assumption"}, {"id": 147, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "hedging", "lines": [[154, 154]], "note": "assesses no-unmeasured-confounding as uncertain, noting unobserved player/match factors"}, {"id": 148, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[155, 155]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 149, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[156, 156]], "note": "numbered assumption title: Positivity"}, {"id": 150, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "framing", "lines": [[157, 157]], "note": "states the positivity assumption"}, {"id": 151, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[158, 158]], "assertion": "the positivity assumption was assessed as likely met, with both groups well-represented across leagues and positions, though goalkeepers are predominantly light-skinned", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["positivity assumption", "skin tone"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 152, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[159, 159]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 153, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[160, 160]], "note": "numbered assumption title: Consistency"}, {"id": 154, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "framing", "lines": [[161, 161]], "note": "states the consistency assumption"}, {"id": 155, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[162, 162]], "assertion": "the consistency assumption was assessed as partially met: skin tone is measured consistently via rater assessment, but the dark/light distinction is somewhat subjective and culturally dependent", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["consistency assumption", "skin tone"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 156, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[163, 163]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 157, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[164, 164]], "note": "numbered assumption title: Correct Model Specification"}, {"id": 158, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "framing", "lines": [[165, 165]], "note": "states the correct-model-specification assumption"}, {"id": 159, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[166, 166]], "assertion": "non-linearities and interactions were not tested for in the model, leaving correct specification uncertain", "polarity": "did_not", "targets": ["model specification"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 160, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[167, 167]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 161, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[168, 168]], "note": "numbered assumption title: Independence of Observations"}, {"id": 162, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "framing", "lines": [[169, 169]], "note": "states the independence-of-observations assumption"}, {"id": 163, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[170, 170]], "assertion": "clustering by player accounts for player-level correlation", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["clustering"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [164]}, {"id": 164, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[170, 170]], "assertion": "referee-level clustering was not addressed, though matches involving the same referee are likely correlated", "polarity": "did_not", "targets": ["clustering", "referee"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [163]}, {"id": 165, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[171, 171]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 166, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[172, 173]], "note": "section divider"}, {"id": 167, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[174, 175]], "note": "Reproducibility heading"}, {"id": 168, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[176, 176]], "assertion": "all analysis code is provided in final_analysis.py", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["analysis code"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [169]}, {"id": 169, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[176, 176]], "assertion": "the workflow is characterized as transparent and reproducible from the raw data", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["workflow", "reproducibility"], "confidence": "low", "shares_lines_with": [168]}, {"id": 170, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[177, 177]], "assertion": "data was loaded from ./data/soccer/soccer.csv", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["data loading"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 171, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[178, 178]], "assertion": "skin tone ratings from the two raters were averaged", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone", "raters"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 172, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[179, 179]], "assertion": "light (≤0.25) vs dark (≥0.5) groups were defined", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 173, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[180, 180]], "assertion": "adjustment was made for position, league, games, and referee country IAT", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["covariates"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 174, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[181, 181]], "assertion": "a logistic regression was fit with player-clustered standard errors", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["logistic regression", "standard errors"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 175, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[182, 182]], "assertion": "marginal effects were calculated for the risk difference", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["marginal effects", "risk difference"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 176, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[183, 183]], "assertion": "confidence intervals were bootstrapped using 10,000 iterations with seed=42", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["confidence interval", "bootstrap"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 177, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[184, 184]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 178, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[185, 186]], "note": "section divider"}, {"id": 179, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[187, 188]], "note": "Sensitivity Analyses heading"}, {"id": 180, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[189, 189]], "assertion": "testing alternative skin tone cutoffs (e.g., tertiles, quartiles) is recommended for future work but was not done", "polarity": "would_have", "targets": ["skin tone cutoffs"], "confidence": "medium", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 181, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[190, 190]], "assertion": "a three-category analysis including medium skin tone is recommended for future work but was not done", "polarity": "would_have", "targets": ["skin tone categories"], "confidence": "medium", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 182, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[191, 191]], "assertion": "a match-level analysis of individual card events is recommended if data become available, but was not done", "polarity": "would_have", "targets": ["match-level analysis"], "confidence": "medium", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 183, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[192, 192]], "assertion": "clustering by both player and referee is recommended for future work but was not done", "polarity": "would_have", "targets": ["clustering"], "confidence": "medium", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 184, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[193, 193]], "assertion": "testing interaction effects (by league, position, or referee bias) is recommended for future work but was not done", "polarity": "would_have", "targets": ["interaction effects"], "confidence": "medium", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 185, "ki